<!-- order-delivery-changed — back-office moved the order to courier delivery, or back to Effy (081).

     ⚠ IT SAYS WHAT CHANGED AND WHAT THE CUSTOMER RECEIVED, NEVER WHY. The staff reason is an internal
     note; the courier fee and Effy's cost are never a customer's to read. The catalogue gives this
     template no var for any of them.

     ⚠ THE SENTENCES ARE NOT WRITTEN HERE. `movedLine` and `compensationLine` arrive already worded by
     `@effy/shared-types` delivery-type.ts — the same words the order page, the receipt and the app
     print. A second wording here is the drift that file exists to prevent.

     ⚠ NO DATE PROMISE for a courier: the timeframe is said as an estimate. -->

<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-include path="../generated/theme.mjml" />
    <mj-title>Your {{effyProductName}} order {{orderNumber}}: a change to its delivery</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>{{movedLine}}</mj-preview>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body width="600px" background-color="#f5f5f5" css-class="e-bg-page">
    <mj-include path="../components/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding="0 32px 32px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="e-ink e-h1">
          A change to your delivery
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="muted" css-class="e-muted" padding="12px 0 0 0">
          Order {{orderNumber}}. {{movedLine}}
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="body" css-class="e-ink" padding="16px 0 0 0">
          {{arrivalLine}}
        </mj-text>

        {{#if hasCompensation}}
        <mj-text mj-class="body" css-class="e-ink" padding="16px 0 0 0">
          {{compensationLine}}
        </mj-text>
        {{/if}}

        <!-- Both dark classes named so the label inverts with the fill (038's dark-mode button). -->
        <mj-button href="{{orderUrl}}" css-class="e-btn-bg e-btn-fg" align="left" padding="24px 0 0 0">
          View your order
        </mj-button>

        <mj-text mj-class="small" css-class="e-muted" padding="20px 0 0 0">
          Sorry for the change. Something not right? Reply to this email or write to {{effySupportEmail}}
          and we&rsquo;ll sort it out.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="../components/footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
